      "richText": false
    },
    {
      "key": "STRINGS.SOCIAL.EFFECTS.CANNIBAL.DESC",
      "seq": 629,
      "source": "那顿饭是谁，心里清楚。有些事情吃下去就吐不出来了。",
      "description": "",
      "arguments": [],
      "richText": false
    },
    {
      "key": "STRINGS.SOCIAL.EFFECTS.RIVAL_DIED.NAME",
      "seq": 630,
      "source": "幸灾乐祸",
      "description": "",
      "arguments": [],
      "richText": false
    },
    {
      "key": "STRINGS.SOCIAL.EFFECTS.RIVAL_DIED.DESC",
      "seq": 631,
      "source": "看不顺眼的那个人不在了。嘴上不说，心情确实不错。",
      "description": "",
      "arguments": [],
      "richText": false
    },
    {
      "key": "STRINGS.SOCIAL.EFFECTS.GRIEF.NAME",
