      "description": "",
      "arguments": [],
      "richText": false
    },
    {
      "key": "STRINGS.SOCIAL.EFFECTS.SIDE_BY_SIDE.DESC",
      "seq": 641,
      "source": "和要好的人一起干活，效率提升。",
      "description": "",
      "arguments": [],
      "richText": false
    },
    {
      "key": "STRINGS.SOCIAL.EFFECTS.STRAINED.NAME",
      "seq": 642,
      "source": "情绪紧绷",
      "description": "",
      "arguments": [],
      "richText": false
    },
    {
      "key": "STRINGS.SOCIAL.EFFECTS.STRAINED.DESC",
      "seq": 643,
      "source": "压力已经逼近极限，随时可能崩溃。找人聊聊、吃顿好的，或者让 TA 歇一歇。",
      "description": "",
      "arguments": [],
      "richText": false
    },
    {
      "key": "STRINGS.SOCIAL.EFFECTS.STRAINED.BUBBLE",
      "seq": 644,
      "source": "深吸一口气……忍住了",
      "description": "压力增量被软上限吃掉时的飘字。",
      "arguments": [],
      "richText": false
    },
    {
      "key": "STRINGS.SOCIAL.EFFECTS.WRATH_ISOLATED.NAME",
      "seq": 645,
      "source": "被孤立",
      "description": "",
      "arguments": [],
      "richText": false
    },
    {
      "key": "STRINGS.SOCIAL.EFFECTS.WRATH_ISOLATED.DESC",
      "seq": 646,
      "source": "殖民地出了事，而 TA 是人缘垫底的那个——所以帐算在 TA 头上了，跟事情是不是 TA 做的无关。有人愿意照顾 TA、找 TA 说话或跟 TA 一起吃顿饭，这个状态就会解除；再久一点，事情也会被淡忘。",
      "description": "",
      "arguments": [],
      "richText": false
    }
